<LanguageData>
  
  <!-- EN:
    <li>questDescription->[Info], the town's doctors are helpless in this situation and hope to seek your assistance.\n\nUpon accepting this request, [escortCount] guerrilla members will escort the patients to your colony for treatment. The group will arrive within [delayTicks_duration]. They will remain in your colony and follow your commands until the treatment is complete. You must ensure the patients' safety; if they die from disease or accidents, your goodwill with the Kiiro will decrease.</li>
    <li>Info->A severe outbreak of [disease_label] has occurred in [kiiro_settlement_label]! Although the town managed to contain the situation in time, [patientCount] residents are still in critical condition</li>
    <li>Info->The Kiiro of [kiiro_settlement_label] recently welcomed a group of companions wandering from afar, among whom [patientCount] Kiiro are suffering from severe [disease_label]</li>
  -->
  <Kiiro_MedicalAssistance.questDescriptionRules.rulesStrings>
    <li>questDescription->[Info]，鎮子上的醫生們對此束手無策，希望能夠尋求你的幫助。\n\n接受該請求后，[escortCount]名游擊隊員會護送患者前來殖民地尋求醫治，隊伍將在[delayTicks_duration]內到達。治療結束前，他們會一直待在你的殖民地並接受你的指揮。你需要保證病人的生命安全，若他們死於疾病或意外則會減少與綺羅的好感度。</li>
    <li>Info->[kiiro_settlement_label]中爆發了嚴重的[disease_label]！雖然城鎮及時控制住了局面，但仍然有[patientCount]位居民病情嚴重</li>
    <li>Info->[kiiro_settlement_label]的綺羅們近日接收了一隊從遠方流浪而來的同伴，其中有[patientCount]名綺羅身患嚴重的[disease_label]</li>
  </Kiiro_MedicalAssistance.questDescriptionRules.rulesStrings>
  <!-- EN:
    <li>questName->medical assistance</li>
  -->
  <Kiiro_MedicalAssistance.questNameRules.rulesStrings>
    <li>questName->醫護援助</li>
  </Kiiro_MedicalAssistance.questNameRules.rulesStrings>
